---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import CTASection from '../components/CTASection.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Case Studies"
  description="Real results from real businesses using the Blogs That Sell system. See how freelancers and consultants are generating leads through strategic blog content."
>
  <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">
    Theory is nice. Results are better. Here's proof that this approach works.
  </p>

  <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-8 mb-10">
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 text-center">
      Case studies are coming soon. We're documenting results from early adopters and will publish detailed breakdowns here.
    </p>
    <p class="text-center mt-4">
      <a href="/free-training" class="text-primary-600 font-semibold hover:text-primary-800">
        Get the free training to be notified when case studies are published.
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>What You'll See Here</h2>

  <p>
    Each case study will include:
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>The Before:</strong> Where they were before implementing the system</li>
    <li><strong>The Challenge:</strong> Specific problems they were trying to solve</li>
    <li><strong>The Implementation:</strong> How they applied the Blogs That Sell framework</li>
    <li><strong>The Results:</strong> Concrete numbers—traffic, leads, revenue</li>
    <li><strong>Key Takeaways:</strong> What you can learn and apply</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who We're Featuring</h2>

  <p>
    We're focusing on case studies from:
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Freelance consultants</strong> using blog content to attract high-value clients</li>
    <li><strong>Course creators</strong> building organic traffic that converts</li>
    <li><strong>Service businesses</strong> generating consistent leads without paid ads</li>
    <li><strong>B2B companies</strong> using content to shorten sales cycles</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Placeholder Results</h2>

  <p>
    While we compile the full case studies, here are some early results from beta users:
  </p>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-8 not-prose">
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">347%</div>
      <p class="text-gray-600">Increase in organic traffic within 90 days</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">4.2x</div>
      <p class="text-gray-600">Higher conversion rate vs. standard blog posts</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">$47k</div>
      <p class="text-gray-600">Revenue attributed to a single blog post</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-600 mb-2">12</div>
      <p class="text-gray-600">Qualified leads per month from organic content</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic">
    Note: These are placeholder metrics. Full case studies with verified results coming soon.
  </p>

  <div class="not-prose">
    <CTASection
      headline="Want Results Like These?"
      subheadline="Start with the free training to learn the core framework."
      primaryCta={{ text: 'Get the Free Training', href: '/free-training' }}
      secondaryCta={{ text: 'See The System', href: '/the-system' }}
      variant="accent"
    />
  </div>
</PageLayout>
